  "notes": "Material-3-like teal tonal theme (#006a6a primary, #aedcdb selected nav pill) on white with pale grey-green surfaces (#f2f5f4) for top bar, pill-shaped icon toolbars and detail card. Selected table row uses grey fill with a teal left bar. Tags in sidebar are outlined pill chips with count pill and pencil rename; a few starred tags carry colour dots (red, orange, green, blue, purple). Detail panel mirrors Zotero's item pane exactly: item type select, creator row with role dropdown, drag handle and +/− controls, empty fields still listed, date with 'y m' parse hint, DOI/URL open-external buttons, Tags/Related/Attachments/Notes sections with + adders, Citation style renderer. Group libraries listed under My Library with people icons."
